    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A study by the Aga Khan University shows that one in every four healthcare professionals exhibits signs of depression. Conducted across all 47 counties in Kenya, the  Protecting the Wellbeing and Strengthening the Resilience of Frontline Health Workers  study  also revealed that two in every five healthcare workers show symptoms of post-traumatic stress disorder.",
